{
    "title": "\u0633\u0631\u0647\u0645\u0628\u0646\u062f\u06cc: \u0628\u0627\u0632\u06cc \u0641\u06a9\u0631\u06cc \u062d\u062f\u0633 \u06a9\u0644\u0645\u0627\u062a",
    "description": "\ud83c\udf1f <b>Matching: a puzzle game that engages your mind. The challenges of this word game are so exciting that you can't stop!</b> \ud83c\udf1f\r\n\ud83d\udc6a This Persian word game is ideal for students. Have fun with this game for hours and solve puzzles and show your knowledge of general information step by step. Riddles are suitable for adults to play with children. \r\n\r\n<p>Are you ready to challenge your mind and immerse yourself in the world of words and puzzles? \"Sarhambandi\" is the intellectual and word game you were looking for! Sarhambandi is a general information game that fills your free time. This game is a healthy and useful entertainment for everyone.\r\n\r\nThe aim of this interesting game is to solve the puzzle and find the password. You will be given a question and some words. Use the colors of the letters as clues to find the correct words. This game starts with easy steps and gradually you face more difficult challenges. This brain game allows you to test your general knowledge, improve your intelligence and become a word puzzle master. This brain game is suitable for adults. But children can also play with adults and expand their vocabulary.</p>\r\n\r\nIf you enjoy games based on word games and in the word search genre, we think you will definitely like this game. Current Sarhambandi players told us this.\r\n\r\n<b>How do I play?</b>\r\n\r\n<p>Enter the word you want to find the answer to the puzzle. After each guess, the color of the letter boxes changes. These colors are your clues to decipher the words. These colors are similar to the colors of nostalgic and old bull and female games or the game of pure thought or superior thought.  Find the password in a few tries. Meaning of letter colors:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\ud83d\udfe9 This letter is in the right place\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udfe8 This letter is present in the code, but it should be moved\r\n\r\n\u2b1b The password does not contain this letter</p>\r\n\r\n<b>Great features of the game:</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\ud83d\udcda Funny questions for solo or group game\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udde0 Varied and interesting puzzles\r\n\ud83c\udfae Challenging daily game\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd22 Hundreds of different and attractive stages\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfac Funny and pleasant animations\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Stunning and eye-catching graphics\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce6 Small volume and easy installation\r\n\ud83d\udcaf Completely free and without in-app payment\r\n\r\n<b>Memory and mental characteristics:</b>\r\n\r\n</p><p>This fun game will improve your general information knowledge and analytical power:</p>\r\n\r\n<p> \ud83d\udcda Increasing the power of analysis \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd6 Increasing public information\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udde0 Increase intelligence (IQ).\r\n\ud83d\udcdd Improving and developing memory\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaf Increasing accuracy and accuracy\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udde0 Strengthening intelligence and strengthening memory\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaf Increasing concentration\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcda expanding the range of words</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Are you ready to face exciting puzzles?</b></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Download Sarhambandi right now and experience a new and interesting hobby and share it with your friends! \ud83d\ude80</p>",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udf1f <b>Matching: a puzzle game that engages your mind. The challenges of this word game are so exciting that you can&#39;t stop!</b> \ud83c\udf1f<br>\ud83d\udc6a This Persian word game is ideal for students. Have fun with this game for hours and solve puzzles and show your knowledge of general information step by step. Riddles are suitable for adults to play with children. <br><br><p>Are you ready to challenge your mind and immerse yourself in the world of words and puzzles? &quot;Sarhambandi&quot; is the intellectual and word game you were looking for! Sarhambandi is a general information game that fills your free time. This game is a healthy and useful entertainment for everyone.<br><br>The aim of this interesting game is to solve the puzzle and find the password. You will be given a question and some words. Use the colors of the letters as clues to find the correct words. This game starts with easy steps and gradually you face more difficult challenges. This brain game allows you to test your general knowledge, improve your intelligence and become a word puzzle master. This brain game is suitable for adults. But children can also play with adults and expand their vocabulary.</p><br><br>If you enjoy games based on word games and in the word search genre, we think you will definitely like this game. Current Sarhambandi players told us this.<br><br><b>How do I play?</b><br><br><p>Enter the word you want to find the answer to the puzzle. After each guess, the color of the letter boxes changes. These colors are your clues to decipher the words. These colors are similar to the colors of nostalgic and old bull and female games or the game of pure thought or superior thought.  Find the password in a few tries. Meaning of letter colors:</p><br><br><p>\ud83d\udfe9 This letter is in the right place<br><br>\ud83d\udfe8 This letter is present in the code, but it should be moved<br><br>\u2b1b The password does not contain this letter</p><br><br><b>Great features of the game:</b><br><br><p>\ud83d\udcda Funny questions for solo or group game<br><br>\ud83e\udde0 Varied and interesting puzzles<br>\ud83c\udfae Challenging daily game<br><br>\ud83d\udd22 Hundreds of different and attractive stages<br><br>\ud83c\udfac Funny and pleasant animations<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 Stunning and eye-catching graphics<br><br>\ud83d\udce6 Small volume and easy installation<br>\ud83d\udcaf Completely free and without in-app payment<br><br><b>Memory and mental characteristics:</b><br><br></p><p>This fun game will improve your general information knowledge and analytical power:</p><br><br><p> \ud83d\udcda Increasing the power of analysis <br><br>\ud83d\udcd6 Increasing public information<br><br>\ud83e\udde0 Increase intelligence (IQ).<br>\ud83d\udcdd Improving and developing memory<br><br>\ud83c\udfaf Increasing accuracy and accuracy<br><br>\ud83e\udde0 Strengthening intelligence and strengthening memory<br><br>\ud83c\udfaf Increasing concentration<br><br>\ud83d\udcda expanding the range of words</p><br><br><p><b>Are you ready to face exciting puzzles?</b></p><br><br><p>Download Sarhambandi right now and experience a new and interesting hobby and share it with your friends! \ud83d\ude80</p>",
